We have a commutative diagram in the category of $\Z^n$-graded algebras:

\[
\xymatrix@C=0.5cm@M=1ex{
\MTWA{n}{k}{r}{s}{\Lambda}  \ar@{->>}[d] \ar@{->>}[drr]
&&                       \\
\hat{\MTWA{n}{k}{r}{s}{\Lambda}}
\ar@<.5ex>@{->}[rr]^{\simeq}
&&  B_n^{\bar q,\Lambda} \ar@<.5ex>@{->}[ll]   \\
&&  A_n^{\bar q,\Lambda} \ar@{^{(}->}[ull] \ar@{^{(}->}[u]
}\]
